ccuses-uefa-of-smear-campaign-against-infantino/a-78896105?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The dispute between the two football associations reached a US court, in which UEFA is looking for permission to collect evidence for criminal proceedings in Switzerland.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Volkswagen to cut 100,000 jobs by end of decade</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bcea1265dee7a3534fcbc7dbad53e7a86e571c9b94b972a818f4fbebbf7b52e7</id><updated>2026-09-04T12:47:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T00:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/volkswagen-to-cut-100-000-jobs-by-end-of-decade/a-78896123--e9df2c0b2270.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/volkswagen-to-cut-100-000-jobs-by-end-of-decade/a-78896123?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The company will carry out the biggest job cuts ever seen in the industry. Volkswagen also plans to restructure and invest in research.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Berlin: BER Airport Terminal 1 reopened after security scare</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:10343ccda4567d3b669bd7c4ca3356a048bacaff20ff25658b4e8b44e1e0c958</id><updated>2026-09-04T12:47:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T21:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/berlin-ber-airport-terminal-1-evacuated-after-security-scare/a-78895207--7a0bcc429d5c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/berlin-ber-airport-terminal-1-reopened-after-security-scare/a-78895207?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police have given the all-clear at Terminal 1 at Berlin's BER Airport following an earlier security scare and evacuation. The airport said some flights had been delayed but they were trying to avoid any cancelations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israel releases first of 5 Lebanese prisoners</title><id>urn:rssync:entry