com/en/trump-s-iran-strategy-could-this-become-a-forever-war/a-78875030?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US has launched fresh attacks on military targets in Iran. It wants to prevent Tehran rebuilding its destroyed capabilities, but risks triggering a sustained downward spiral of reconstruction followed by new attacks.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Norway seizes Russian ship in Svalbard to compensate Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8e81d9727b72846bb8af571466a19c1baae76ce265a40d923c15c6dd27a3ba98</id><updated>2026-09-04T12:47:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T15:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-seizes-russian-ship-in-svalbard-to-compensate-ukraine/a-78889005--71c4decbfa77.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-seizes-russian-ship-in-svalbard-to-compensate-ukraine/a-78889005?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities in Norway have seized a Russian ship, the Professor Molchanov, on a court order sought and obtained by Naftogaz in Ukraine. Russia has protested the move, which stems from its refusal to pay Naftogaz damages.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
